<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Simulado Digital 4º Ano - Campos dos Goytacazes | Portal de Atividades</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.6.0/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>
  
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #0284c7;
      --primary-dark: #0369a1;
      --primary-light: #e0f2fe;
      --accent: #f59e0b;
      --success: #10b981;
      --danger: #ef4444;
      --bg: #f8fafc;
      --card-bg: #ffffff;
      --text: #0f172a;
      --text-muted: #64748b;
      --border: #e2e8f0;
      --radius: 16px;
      --shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.01);
      --shadow-hover: 0 20px 30px -10px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.15);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding-bottom: 60px;
    }

    /* Top Navigation Header */
    .top-header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7 0%, #1e40af 100%);
      color: white;
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .top-header-container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .header-branding {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .header-badge {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .header-title h1 {
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .header-title p {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .nav-back-btn {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
    }

    .nav-back-btn:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    /* Main Container Layout */
    .main-container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 2rem auto;
      padding: 0 1rem;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 340px;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .main-container {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    /* Student Info Box */
    .student-card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      border: 2px solid #e0f2fe;
    }

    .student-card h2 {
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .form-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      .form-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    .form-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .form-group label {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .form-control {
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      border: 2px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-family: inherit;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      outline: none;
    }

    .form-control:focus {
      border-color: var(--primary);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.15);
    }

    /* Question Cards */
    .question-card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.8rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
      scroll-margin-top: 100px;
    }

    .question-card:hover {
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
    }

    .question-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
      padding-bottom: 0.8rem;
      border-bottom: 2px dashed #f1f5f9;
    }

    .question-tag {
      background: var(--primary-light);
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    }

    .bncc-tag {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      background: #f1f5f9;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* Dialog Box Component */
    .dialog-box {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .avatar-icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      background: #fef3c7;
      color: #b45309;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    }

    .dialog-content strong {
      color: #92400e;
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
    }

    .dialog-content p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #334155;
    }

    /* Text Content Container */
    .story-box {
      background: #fffbeb;
      border: 2px solid #fde68a;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 1.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
      color: #78350f;
    }

    .story-box h3 {
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
      color: #92400e;
    }

    .story-box p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .question-text {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1e293b;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }

    /* Options List */
    .options-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .option-label {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem;
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 2px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .option-label:hover {
      background: #f0f9ff;
      border-color: #7dd3fc;
    }

    .option-input {
      display: none;
    }

    .option-badge {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: white;
      border: 2px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-right: 1rem;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .option-input:checked + .option-label {
      background: #e0f2fe;
      border-color: var(--primary);
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.15);
    }

    .option-input:checked + .option-label .option-badge {
      background: var(--primary);
      border-color: var(--primary);
      color: white;
    }

    /* Essay Question Textarea */
    .essay-textarea {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 160px;
      padding: 1rem;
      border: 2px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      outline: none;
      resize: vertical;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .essay-textarea:focus {
      border-color: var(--primary);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.15);
    }

    /* Sticky Sidebar - Cartão Resposta */
    .sidebar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 100px;
      height: fit-content;
    }

    .cartao-resposta-card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border: 2px solid #bae6fd;
    }

    .cartao-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
      padding-bottom: 0.8rem;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #f1f5f9;
    }

    .cartao-header h3 {
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
    }

    .cartao-header p {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    .progress-bar-container {
      width: 100%;
      height: 8px;
      background: #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin: 0.8rem 0;
    }

    .progress-bar-fill {
      height: 100%;
      width: 0%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--success) 100%);
      transition: width 0.3s ease;
    }

    .bubble-grid {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.6rem;
    }

    .bubble-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      background: #f8fafc;
      padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .bubble-row-q {
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      width: 38px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .bubble-row-q:hover {
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .bubbles-options {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .bubble-dot {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 2px solid #cbd5e1;
      background: white;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #64748b;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .bubble-dot.selected {
      background: var(--primary);
      border-color: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      transform: scale(1.1);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.4);
    }

    .bubble-dot.essay-done {
      background: var(--success);
      border-color: var(--success);
      color: white;
    }

    /* Submit Button */
    .submit-btn {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .submit-btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 24px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
    }

    /* Result Overlay Modal */
    .result-modal {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      z-index: 1000;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 1rem;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }

    .result-modal.active {
      display: flex;
    }

    .result-content {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 24px;
      max-width: 600px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      animation: popIn 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
    }

    @keyframes popIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.8); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    }

    .score-circle {
      width: 110px;
      height: 110px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0f2fe 0%, #bae6fd 100%);
      color: var(--primary-dark);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;
      border: 4px solid var(--primary);
    }

    .score-num {
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .score-total {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    /* Feedback list in result */
    .gabarito-list {
      text-align: left;
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
      background: #f8fafc;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1rem;
      max-height: 200px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .gabarito-item {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0.4rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }

    .gabarito-item:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .badge-correct { color: var(--success); font-weight: 800; }
    .badge-wrong { color: var(--danger); font-weight: 800; }

    .modal-btn {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    /* Table styles for Q7 */
    .table-custom {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 1rem 0;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .table-custom th, .table-custom td {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .table-custom th {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      font-weight: 800;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Header Banner -->
  <header class="top-header">
    <div class="top-header-container">
      <div class="header-branding">
        <span class="header-badge">Campos dos Goytacazes</span>
        <div class="header-title">
          <h1>SIMULADO DIGITAL - 4º ANO</h1>
          <p>Projeto Campos de Todos Nós • Blocos 1 e 2 (Agosto/2026)</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="/" class="nav-back-btn">
        <span>← Voltar ao Portal</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Grid -->
  <main class="main-container">
    
    <!-- Left Column: Student Info & Questions -->
    <div class="content-col">

      <!-- Student Identification Box -->
      <section class="student-card">
        <h2>👤 Identificação do Estudante</h2>
        <form id="student-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();">
          <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="studentName">Nome Completo do Estudante *</label>
              <input type="text" id="studentName" class="form-control" placeholder="Digite seu nome completo..." required>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="schoolName">Escola Municipal</label>
              <input type="text" id="schoolName" class="form-control" placeholder="Nome da escola..." value="E.M. Campos de Todos Nós">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="className">Turma</label>
              <input type="text" id="className" class="form-control" placeholder="Ex: 4º Ano A" value="4º Ano A">
            </div>
          </div>
        </form>
      </section>

      <!-- QUESTÃO 1 (Língua Portuguesa) -->
      <article class="question-card" id="q-card-1">
        <div class="question-header">
          <span class="question-tag">QUESTÃO 01 • Língua Portuguesa</span>
          <span class="bncc-tag">BNCC EF35LP05</span>
        </div>

        <div class="dialog-box">
          <div class="avatar-icon">👩‍🏫</div>
          <div class="dialog-content">
            <strong>Professora Bia conversa com Mirela:</strong>
            <p>"Mirela, quando dizemos que a comunidade de Campos precisa <em>preservar</em> o Rio Paraíba do Sul e os patrimônios históricos da nossa cidade, o que essa palavra significa no texto?"</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="question-text">
          Assinale a opção em que a palavra <strong>PRESERVAR</strong> possui o mesmo sentido empregado na fala da Professora Bia:
        </p>

        <div class="options-grid">
          <label class="option-label">
            <input type="radio" name="q1" value="A" class="option-input" onchange="updateCartao(1, 'A')">
            <span class="option-badge">A</span>
            <span>Destruir as áreas antigas para construir novas estradas.</span>
          </label>
          <label class="option-label">
            <input type="radio" name="q1" value="B" class="option-input" onchange="updateCartao(1, 'B')">
            <span class="option-badge">B</span>
            <span>Proteger, cuidar e manter conservado contra danos ou destruição.</span>
          </label>
          <label class="option-label">
            <input type="radio" name="q1" value="C" class="option-input" onchange="updateCartao(1, 'C')">
            <span class="option-badge">C</span>
            <span>Esconder as riquezas naturais para que ninguém possa visitar.</span>
          </label>
          <label class="option-label">
            <input type="radio" name="q1" value="D" class="option-input" onchange="updateCartao(1, 'D')">
            <span class="option-badge">D</span>
            <span>Vender os monumentos históricos para outras cidades.</span>
          </label>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- QUESTÃO 2 (Língua Portuguesa) -->
      <article class="question-card" id="q-card-2">
        <div class="question-header">
          <span class="question-tag">QUESTÃO 02 • Língua Portuguesa</span>
          <span class="bncc-tag">BNCC EF35LP06</span>
        </div>

        <div class="dialog-box">
          <div class="avatar-icon">👦</div>
          <div class="dialog-content">
            <strong>Enzo explicou ao grupo:</strong>
            <p>"Os moradores ficaram muito felizes <strong>porque</strong> o Museu Histórico de Campos foi restaurado e reaberto para visitação das escolas."</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="question-text">
          A palavra destacada <strong>PORQUE</strong> estabelece na frase uma relação de:
        </p>

        <div class="options-grid">
          <label class="option-label">
            <input type="radio" name="q2" value="A" class="option-input" onchange="updateCartao(2, 'A')">
            <span class="option-badge">A</span>
            <span>Tempo.</span>
          </label>
          <label class="option-label">
            <input type="radio" name="q2" value="B" class="option-input" onchange="updateCartao(2, 'B')">
            <span class="option-badge">B</span>
            <span>Oposição.</span>
          </label>
          <label class="option-label">
            <input type="radio" name="q2" value="C" class="option-input" onchange="updateCartao(2, 'C')">
            <span class="option-badge">C</span>
            <span>Dúvida.</span>
          </label>
          <label class="option-label">
            <input type="radio" name="q2" value="D" class="option-input" onchange="updateCartao(2, 'D')">
            <span class="option-badge">D</span>
            <span>Causa ou Motivo.</span>
          </label>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- QUESTÃO 3 (Produção Textual / Redação) -->
      <article class="question-card" id="q-card-3">
        <div class="question-header">
          <span class="question-tag">QUESTÃO 03 • Produção Textual (Redação)</span>
          <span class="bncc-tag">BNCC EF35LP25</span>
        </div>

        <div class="story-box">
          <h3>📜 O Misterioso Encontro no Rio Paraíba do Sul</h3>
          <p>
            <em>"Era uma noite tranquila às margens do rio Paraíba do Sul. Mirela e Enzo estavam no Cais da Lapa observando as luzes refletidas na água, quando de repente viram algo brilhar intensamente perto das pedras..."</em>
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="question-text">
          Continue a história acima! Escreva o que Mirela e Enzo encontraram, o que aconteceu em seguida e como essa aventura terminou (mínimo de 5 linhas):
        </p>

        <textarea id="q3Essay" class="essay-textarea" placeholder="Continue a história aqui com suas palavras..." oninput="updateEssayCartao()"></textarea>
      </article>

      <!-- QUESTÃO 4 (Língua Portuguesa) -->
      <article class="question-card" id="q-card-4">
        <div class="question-header">
          <span class="question-tag">QUESTÃO 04 • Língua Portuguesa</span>
          <span class="bncc-tag">BNCC EF35LP21</span>
        </div>

        <div class="story-box">
          <h3>👻 A Lenda da Curva da Loira</h3>
          <p>
